    "Prompt (+ optional photo) -> Gaussian splat, in four steps. Press Queue (Run).\n\n1 Image   FLUX.2 Klein: the person in an A-pose in a grey studio (from the photo if one is connected)\n2 Views   side and back views on the same grey: scout orbit, cut out, re-lit\n3 Video   MiniMax H3 circles the person, pinned to those views\n4 Splat   upscale, masks, matte, camera poses, training, clean-up, export\n\nEach step keeps its result in ComfyUI/output/profsplat/<run>/ and is skipped while its settings and inputs are unchanged: change one setting and only that step and the ones after it run again.\ndry_run (node 1): generates nothing, shows the stored result of every step of the professor run."
